# VALIDATION SMOKE for harbor-miles (coordinator-scheduled; ~45-60 min incl. ~20 min setup/JIT): the 27b-2n layout at 96k with
# every derived knob in play (logprob chunk 1024, trainer-only expandable segments, 3 engines, node_peer agent server on node 1).
# 2 short de4 tasks x 4 attempts, 2 steps (step 1 decodes on the synced merged weights), zero-variance groups kept, 900 s agents.
# Pass: config line + args (tools/dry_render.sh output matches args-<job>.txt), sandboxes on both nodes, 2 train steps, no OOM.
RUN_NAME=hm-smoke-27b-2n-96k
LAYOUT_PRESET=27b-2n
DATASET=de4-v1-k1
TASK_IDS_FILE=${HM_EXAMPLE_DIR}/configs/tasks/de4-smoke2-short.txt
CAP=96k
RBS=2
NS=4
NUM_ROLLOUT=2
ASYNC_CONCURRENCY=8
DROP_ZERO_STD=0
HM_AGENT_TIMEOUT=900
HM_CHAIN_MAX=0
